  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a large oven-safe Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Stir in the cumin, coriander, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the chopped pecans and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped dried apricots and stir to combine.",
    "Transfer the Dutch oven to the preheated oven and bake for 20 minutes.",
    "Remove the tagine from the oven and let it cool for a few minutes before serving."
